{"seq":1,"slug":"architecture-testing-strategies","title":"架构测试策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/practice/architecture-testing-strategies","wordCount":1091,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"架构测试策略\">架构测试策略</h1><p>架构的可测试性不是事后补测试——它是架构设计的首要约束之一。如果一个架构方案无法在合理成本下被自动化验证，那它在生产环境中的正确性就只能依赖人工代码审查和祈祷。本篇建立移动端架构的测试金字塔，按层提供测试策略、工具选型和投入产出比分析。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>测试金字塔移动端定制</strong>：底层单元测试占 50%（快/便宜/稳定），UI/E2E 测试占 20%（慢/贵/Flaky）——与架构分层对齐</li>\n<li><strong>架构可测试性是设计约束</strong>：选型时&quot;这个方案的测试成本是多少&quot;应该是前三个评估维度之一</li>\n<li><strong>架构规则自动化验证</strong>：使用 ArchUnit 等工具在 CI 中监控依赖方向违规，将架构退化拦截在代码审查阶段</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"测试金字塔-移动端定制版\">测试金字塔：移动端定制版</h2><p>经典测试金字塔在移动端需要调整——UI 测试的成本极高（真机/模拟器依赖、执行慢、Flaky），因此底层测试的比重应该更大：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 金字塔&#10;        E2E[E2E / 手动&lt;br/&gt;5%]&#10;        UI[UI 测试&lt;br/&gt;15%]&#10;        INT[集成测试&lt;br/&gt;30%]&#10;        UNIT[单元测试&lt;br/&gt;50%]&#10;    end&#10;    E2E --&gt; UI --&gt; INT --&gt; UNIT\">graph TD\n    subgraph 金字塔\n        E2E[E2E / 手动&lt;br/&gt;5%]\n        UI[UI 测试&lt;br/&gt;15%]\n        INT[集成测试&lt;br/&gt;30%]\n        UNIT[单元测试&lt;br/&gt;50%]\n    end\n    E2E --&gt; UI --&gt; INT --&gt; UNIT</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>覆盖目标</th>\n<th>执行速度</th>\n<th>维护成本</th>\n<th>工具 (Android)</th>\n<th>工具 (iOS)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>Reducer/ViewModel/UseCase</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>JUnit5 + Turbine + MockK</td>\n<td>XCTest + Swift Testing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试</td>\n<td>Repository + 数据库/网络 Mock</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>Robolectric + Room inMemory</td>\n<td>XCTest + URLProtocol Mock</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UI 测试</td>\n<td>组件渲染 + 交互</td>\n<td>10-30 秒</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>Compose UI Test</td>\n<td>XCUITest / ViewInspector</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E2E</td>\n<td>完整用户流程</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>Maestro / Appium</td>\n<td>Maestro / XCUITest</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"按架构层的测试策略\">按架构层的测试策略</h2><h3 id=\"domain-层-纯单元测试\">Domain 层：纯单元测试</h3><p>Domain 层（Entity + Use Case）是纯业务逻辑，无平台依赖，测试最简单：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class PlaceOrderUseCaseTest {&#10;    private val fakeOrderRepo = FakeOrderRepository()&#10;    private val fakeInventoryRepo = FakeInventoryRepository()&#10;    private val fakePaymentService = FakePaymentService()&#10;&#10;    private val useCase = PlaceOrderUseCase(fakeOrderRepo, fakeInventoryRepo, fakePaymentService)&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `out of stock items fail fast without charging`() = runTest {&#10;        fakeInventoryRepo.setAvailable(false)&#10;&#10;        val result = useCase(Cart(items = listOf(item1)))&#10;&#10;        assertTrue(result.isFailure)&#10;        assertIs&lt;OutOfStockException&gt;(result.exceptionOrNull())&#10;        assertEquals(0, fakePaymentService.chargeCount) // 未扣款&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `discount applied for 5+ items`() = runTest {&#10;        fakeInventoryRepo.setAvailable(true)&#10;        fakePaymentService.setSuccess(true)&#10;&#10;        val cart = Cart(items = List(5) { item1 })&#10;        useCase(cart)&#10;&#10;        // 验证折扣：原价 * 0.92&#10;        val expectedCharge = cart.totalPrice * 0.92.toBigDecimal()&#10;        assertEquals(expectedCharge, fakePaymentService.lastChargedAmount)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class PlaceOrderUseCaseTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val fakeOrderRepo = FakeOrderRepository()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val fakeInventoryRepo = FakeInventoryRepository()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val fakePaymentService = FakePaymentService()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val useCase = PlaceOrderUseCase(fakeOrderRepo, fakeInventoryRepo, fakePaymentService)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `out of stock items fail fast without charging`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fakeInventoryRepo.setAvailable(false)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val result = useCase(Cart(items = listOf(item1)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertTrue(result.isFailure)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertIs&#x3C;OutOfStockException>(result.exceptionOrNull())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(0, fakePaymentService.chargeCount) // 未扣款</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `discount applied for 5+ items`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fakeInventoryRepo.setAvailable(true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fakePaymentService.setSuccess(true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val cart = Cart(items = List(5) { item1 })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        useCase(cart)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 验证折扣：原价 * 0.92</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val expectedCharge = cart.totalPrice * 0.92.toBigDecimal()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(expectedCharge, fakePaymentService.lastChargedAmount)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"presentation-层-viewmodel-reducer-测试\">Presentation 层：ViewModel/Reducer 测试</h3><p>ViewModel 测试验证&quot;给定输入事件，产出正确的状态序列&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class SearchViewModelTest {&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `search emits loading then results`() = runTest {&#10;        val fakeUseCase = FakeSearchUseCase(result = listOf(product1, product2))&#10;        val viewModel = SearchViewModel(fakeUseCase)&#10;&#10;        viewModel.state.test {&#10;            assertEquals(SearchState(), awaitItem()) // 初始态&#10;&#10;            viewModel.dispatch(SearchIntent.Search)&#10;&#10;            assertEquals(true, awaitItem().isLoading)  // Loading&#10;            val final = awaitItem()&#10;            assertEquals(false, final.isLoading)&#10;            assertEquals(2, final.results.size)       // 结果&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class SearchViewModelTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `search emits loading then results`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val fakeUseCase = FakeSearchUseCase(result = listOf(product1, product2))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val viewModel = SearchViewModel(fakeUseCase)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModel.state.test {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            assertEquals(SearchState(), awaitItem()) // 初始态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            viewModel.dispatch(SearchIntent.Search)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            assertEquals(true, awaitItem().isLoading)  // Loading</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val final = awaitItem()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            assertEquals(false, final.isLoading)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            assertEquals(2, final.results.size)       // 结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>TCA 的 <code>TestStore</code> 提供了更严格的穷举验证——每一步状态变化和每一个 Effect 都必须被显式断言：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"@Test&#10;func searchFlow() async {&#10;    let store = TestStore(initialState: SearchFeature.State()) {&#10;        SearchFeature()&#10;    } withDependencies: {&#10;        $0.searchClient.search = { _ in [Product(id: &quot;1&quot;, name: &quot;Widget&quot;)] }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    await store.send(.queryChanged(&quot;widget&quot;)) { $0.query = &quot;widget&quot; }&#10;    await store.send(.search) { $0.isLoading = true }&#10;    await store.receive(.searchResponse(.success([Product(id: &quot;1&quot;, name: &quot;Widget&quot;)]))) {&#10;        $0.isLoading = false&#10;        $0.results = [Product(id: &quot;1&quot;, name: &quot;Widget&quot;)]&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> searchFlow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> store </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> TestStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">initialState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: SearchFeature.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">State</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        SearchFeature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">withDependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        $0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.searchClient.search </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">_</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Widget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> store.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">queryChanged</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"widget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.query </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"widget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> store.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.search) { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.isLoading </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> store.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">receive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">searchResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">success</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Widget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)]))) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        $0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.isLoading </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        $0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Widget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"data-层-集成测试\">Data 层：集成测试</h3><p>Data 层测试验证 Repository 正确协调远程/本地数据源：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class OrderRepositoryImplTest {&#10;    private val fakeRemote = FakeOrderRemoteDataSource()&#10;    private val testDb = Room.inMemoryDatabaseBuilder(context, AppDatabase::class.java).build()&#10;    private val localDao = testDb.orderDao()&#10;&#10;    private val repository = OrderRepositoryImpl(fakeRemote, OrderLocalDataSource(localDao))&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `returns cached data when available and refreshes in background`() = runTest {&#10;        // 预存缓存&#10;        localDao.insertAll(listOf(cachedOrder))&#10;&#10;        val result = repository.getOrders()&#10;&#10;        // 立即返回缓存&#10;        assertEquals(listOf(cachedOrder.toDomain()), result.getOrNull())&#10;&#10;        // 等待后台刷新完成&#10;        advanceUntilIdle()&#10;        val refreshed = localDao.getAll()&#10;        assertEquals(fakeRemote.orders.map { it.toEntity() }, refreshed)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class OrderRepositoryImplTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val fakeRemote = FakeOrderRemoteDataSource()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val testDb = Room.inMemoryDatabaseBuilder(context, AppDatabase::class.java).build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val localDao = testDb.orderDao()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val repository = OrderRepositoryImpl(fakeRemote, OrderLocalDataSource(localDao))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `returns cached data when available and refreshes in background`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 预存缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        localDao.insertAll(listOf(cachedOrder))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val result = repository.getOrders()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 立即返回缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(listOf(cachedOrder.toDomain()), result.getOrNull())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 等待后台刷新完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        advanceUntilIdle()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val refreshed = localDao.getAll()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(fakeRemote.orders.map { it.toEntity() }, refreshed)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"snapshot-testing-状态的视觉验证\">Snapshot Testing：状态的视觉验证</h2><p>Snapshot testing 对 MVI/TCA 架构特别友好——因为 State 是纯值类型，可以构造任意 State 直接渲染 UI 并截图比对：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// iOS Snapshot Test&#10;func testProductListLoadedState() {&#10;    let state = ProductListFeature.State(&#10;        products: [.mock(name: &quot;Widget&quot;), .mock(name: &quot;Gadget&quot;)],&#10;        isLoading: false&#10;    )&#10;    let view = ProductListView(store: Store(initialState: state) { ProductListFeature() })&#10;&#10;    assertSnapshot(of: view, as: .image(layout: .device(config: .iPhone13)))&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// iOS Snapshot Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> testProductListLoadedState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ProductListFeature.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">State</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        products</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">mock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Widget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">mock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Gadget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        isLoading</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> view </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ProductListView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">store</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Store</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">initialState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: state) { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ProductListFeature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    assertSnapshot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: view, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">layout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">device</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .iPhone13)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>截图内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Loading</td>\n<td>骨架屏/Shimmer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Empty</td>\n<td>空态插画 + 提示文案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Loaded (1 item)</td>\n<td>单行列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Loaded (100 items)</td>\n<td>满屏滚动列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Error</td>\n<td>错误提示 + 重试按钮</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"架构约束的自动化验证\">架构约束的自动化验证</h2><p>除了功能测试，架构规则本身也应该被自动化验证：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// ArchUnit（Android）—— 验证依赖方向&#10;@Test&#10;fun `domain layer does not depend on data or presentation`() {&#10;    ArchRuleDefinition.noClasses()&#10;        .that().resideInAPackage(&quot;..domain..&quot;)&#10;        .should().dependOnClassesThat().resideInAnyPackage(&quot;..data..&quot;, &quot;..presentation..&quot;)&#10;        .check(importedClasses)&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Test&#10;fun `feature modules do not depend on each other`() {&#10;    ArchRuleDefinition.noClasses()&#10;        .that().resideInAPackage(&quot;..feature.home..&quot;)&#10;        .should().dependOnClassesThat().resideInAPackage(&quot;..feature.cart..&quot;)&#10;        .check(importedClasses)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// ArchUnit（Android）—— 验证依赖方向</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun `domain layer does not depend on data or presentation`() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ArchRuleDefinition.noClasses()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .that().resideInAPackage(\"..domain..\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .should().dependOnClassesThat().resideInAnyPackage(\"..data..\", \"..presentation..\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .check(importedClasses)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun `feature modules do not depend on each other`() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ArchRuleDefinition.noClasses()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .that().resideInAPackage(\"..feature.home..\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .should().dependOnClassesThat().resideInAPackage(\"..feature.cart..\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .check(importedClasses)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>架构腐化率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>违反依赖规则的 import 数</mtext><mtext>总 import 数</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{架构腐化率} = \\frac{\\text{违反依赖规则的 import 数}}{\\text{总 import 数}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">架构腐化率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总</span><span class=\"mord\"> import </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">违反依赖规则的</span><span class=\"mord\"> import </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当这个指标从 CI 中持续监控时，架构退化可以在代码审查阶段被自动拦截。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测试投入的-roi-分析\">测试投入的 ROI 分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试类型</th>\n<th>编写成本</th>\n<th>维护成本</th>\n<th>Bug 检出率</th>\n<th>CI 时间占比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Reducer 单元测试</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>高（逻辑 Bug）</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ViewModel 流测试</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（状态流 Bug）</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Repository 集成测试</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中（数据层 Bug）</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UI Snapshot 测试</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中（UI 变更需更新快照）</td>\n<td>中（视觉回归）</td>\n<td>30%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E2E 测试</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极高（Flaky）</td>\n<td>低（已被底层覆盖）</td>\n<td>35%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>投入产出比最高的测试类型是 <strong>Reducer/ViewModel 单元测试</strong>——编写快、运行快、维护成本低、能覆盖大部分业务逻辑 Bug。这也是为什么 TCA 和 MVI 将&quot;可测试性&quot;作为一等设计目标的原因——它们的架构约束使得这类测试的编写变得自然而非强制。</p>\n<p>测试策略不是孤立的——它与架构模式紧密耦合。<a href=\"../foundations/mvc-mvp-mvvm\">MVC/MVP/MVVM</a> 的选型直接决定了 Presentation 层的可测试性上限；<a href=\"../foundations/clean-architecture-mobile\">Clean Architecture</a> 的分层决定了 Domain 层能否纯单元测试。当你在做架构选型时，&quot;这个方案的测试成本是多少&quot;应该是前三个评估维度之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>架构测试策略的核心洞察是：越靠近底层（Reducer/UseCase）的测试投入产出比越高——写得快、跑得快、维护成本低、覆盖率高。TCA 和 MVI 将&quot;可测试性&quot;作为一等设计目标，使得 Reducer 纯函数测试成为最自然的验证方式。Snapshot Testing 利用 UDF 架构的 State 可构造性实现了视觉回归检测。ArchUnit 类工具将架构原则从&quot;团队约定&quot;升级为&quot;CI 门禁&quot;，是防止架构腐化的自动化屏障。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"架构测试策略","id":"架构测试策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"测试金字塔：移动端定制版","id":"测试金字塔-移动端定制版"},{"level":2,"text":"按架构层的测试策略","id":"按架构层的测试策略"},{"level":3,"text":"Domain 层：纯单元测试","id":"domain-层-纯单元测试"},{"level":3,"text":"Presentation 层：ViewModel/Reducer 测试","id":"presentation-层-viewmodel-reducer-测试"},{"level":3,"text":"Data 层：集成测试","id":"data-层-集成测试"},{"level":2,"text":"Snapshot Testing：状态的视觉验证","id":"snapshot-testing-状态的视觉验证"},{"level":2,"text":"架构约束的自动化验证","id":"架构约束的自动化验证"},{"level":2,"text":"测试投入的 ROI 分析","id":"测试投入的-roi-分析"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"移动端状态管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/cross-cutting/state-management-mobile"},"next":{"title":"遗留代码迁移模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/practice/legacy-migration-patterns"}}